    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a trait that affects decision-making of individuals. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_decisions_trait" kindref="compound">DecisionsTrait</ref> inherits from <ref refid="class_trait" kindref="compound">Trait</ref> and may contain individual-level traits. It provides methods to check trait constraints, handle JSON configuration, and serialize the trait for persistence. </para>
